-(deftest a-cell-key-names-one-cell
-  ;; the generators never span 65 536 cells, so the packing's digits are checked here directly: every triple of indices
-  ;; at and around the packing's limits, and beyond them (the string keys), has its own key — 0 and −0 one key, as the
